
---

Now create `.gitignore`:

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo

# Virtual Environment
venv/
env/
.venv/

# Environment variables
.env

# Database
*.sqlite
*.db

# PostgreSQL
postgres_data/

# Pytest
.pytest_cache/
.coverage

# Logs
*.log

# FastAPI
*.pid

# Docker
.docker/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Build
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# Temporary
*.tmp
*.temp

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Node (if frontend added)
node_modules/